rØ  a€  You can use tools. To use one, reply with ONLY one JSON object, nothing else:
{"tool": "<name>", "args": {...}}
Tools:
- list_dir: {"path": "."}  lists files in a folder
- read_file: {"path": "notes.txt"}  reads a text file
- calculator: {"expression": "2*(3+4)"}  does arithmetic
After you get a TOOL RESULT, answer the user in plain text. If no tool is needed, answer in plain text.c                 C   s¬   t | tjƒr
